<title>USA: Greenleaf to buy Clearview Technologies.</title>
<headline>Greenleaf to buy Clearview Technologies.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenleaf Capital Corp said Thursday it signed a letter of intent to buy privately-held Clearview Technologies Inc of Austin in a share exchange.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to close the deal on or before September 30. It added Clearview develops computer data security solutions.</p>
<p>Greenleaf's stock closed at 7/8 Monday.</p>
